---
title: Red Lentil Curry
description: This luxurious, fan favorite Red Lentil Curry will get you truly excited about lentils! It’s an ultra-creamy and gourmet Indian-inspired meal made in one pot with pantry staples. Whip it up on a weeknight in 45 minutes!
image: https://rainbowplantlife.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/red2Blentil2Bcurry2Bangled2B-2B20202Bupdated2B2812Bof2B12928129.jpg
diet: Vegan
servings: '4'
cuisine: Indian
time required: 45 minutes
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 35 minutes
source: https://rainbowplantlife.com/vegan-red-lentil-curry
tags: curry, lentils, spicy, vegan, indian-inspired, dinner, gluten-free
course: Dinner
nutrition:
  calories: 517 kcal
